        <p class="profile-detail-region">Life · Egypt &amp; North Africa</p>
        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Ibn Khaldun</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1332 CE – 1406 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">26 or 27 May 1332 (1 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramadan">Ramadan</a> 732 AH) in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tunis">Tunis</a>, into the Banū Khaldūn, an upper-class Andalusian family of Yemeni Arab descent</span></div>
